<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36766" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξανα-φέρω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bear up,</i> of buoyant sea-water, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				217
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. λόγχης τύπον</span>
			<i>exhibit</i> the form of a spear, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.563a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>weather the storm,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pyrrh.</u>
				15
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν νοσήματι κατειλημμένος ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2
				</span></i>
			. 
			<i><span class="en">
				147c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὴν ἀδηλότητα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Oth.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. καὶ διωθεῖσθαι τὸ πάθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.446b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				541a
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				550c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>rise in the scale,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ ζυγοῦ πρὸς τὰ βελτίονα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				469b
			</span></i>.</div>
